WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.990
- Really, why we love to do what we do is

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.320
because it's continuing Dad's legacy,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.175
and his mission to teach
people about animals.

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:08.888
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.888 --> 00:00:12.008
- And you're getting
married next year, right?

00:00:12.008 --> 00:00:13.230
- Oh, my goodness!
- And at the zoo, right?

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.820
- Yes, right at Australia Zoo.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.653
- Congratulations!

00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:19.057
(audience applauds)
- Oh, I didn't know!

00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:20.708
- So, I mean, are you like,

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:21.830
is he walking you down the aisle,

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.375
a koala walking you down
the aisle, what's happening?

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.930
- That's a good question, maybe both.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.860
Maybe Robert and a koala
could walk me down the aisle.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.840
- Exactly, we're gonna have
animals involved somehow.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.673
(Bindi laughs)

00:00:29.673 --> 00:00:31.110
- Yes, but definitely,

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.610
Robert's gonna walk me down the aisle.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.637
- I was so incredibly
touched when Bindi said,

00:00:35.637 --> 00:00:37.780
"Robert, would you walk
me down the aisle?"

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.219
And yeah, I think, I mean I
know Dad would be so proud

00:00:40.219 --> 00:00:43.040
of you, and we all love you so much.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.840
You're achieving so much, so
it's gonna be such an honor,

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.450
yeah, to, and Chandler is actually,

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:51.220
he is such a great team member.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.053
He's incredible.

00:00:52.053 --> 00:00:53.180
(audience applauds)

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.970
- Bindi and Robert's mom Terri,

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:56.555
here in the audience with us.

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:57.388
How exciting!

00:00:57.388 --> 00:00:58.936
(audience applauds)

00:00:58.936 --> 00:01:02.230
I mean, first of all, I mean, yes,

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.760
it's exciting your
daughter's getting married,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.070
but also they're carrying

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:06.930
on what your husband did his whole life.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.095
That's a beautiful thing that
y'all are all still continuing

00:01:09.095 --> 00:01:12.730
that and changing lives, exactly
what he would have wanted.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:13.950
How proud are you?
(audience applauds)

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:18.950
- Yeah, it's very special,
but I do like how a friend

00:01:19.383 --> 00:01:22.177
of mine summed up Chandler,
'cause I said to her,

00:01:22.177 --> 00:01:26.467
"You know, Chandler is so
kind and loving and respectful

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:29.870
"and loyal to Bindi that
he's the perfect guy."

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:33.280
He doesn't even drink, and
my friend, she said to me--

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.280
- Problem A.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.950
- Oh, my gosh!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.995
You have a designated driver for life.

00:01:37.995 --> 00:01:39.568
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.568 --> 00:01:40.651
- Oh, my God!

00:01:41.881 --> 00:01:42.714
- He's perfect!

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:44.024
It's a match made in heaven.

00:01:44.024 --> 00:01:44.874
- That's amazing!

